Package: ros.form.observe
Title: Populate Regional Observer Scheme Forms from ObServe Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Tony", "Chemit", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "dev@tchemit.fr",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0007-1802-5256", URL = "https://ultreia.io"))
Description: Provides the package structure for populating Regional Observer
    Scheme forms from ObServe data. The export design covers longline and
    purse-seine forms using shared form definitions, reference catalogues
    and validation rules.
